## Survey overview

How do large language models use symbolic solvers, and what can a solver result establish? The survey organizes the literature around five overlapping roles and compares reported outcomes across tasks, models, and computational budgets. It examines when a successful formal check supports a claim about the original task. [Survey framework](docs/taxonomy.md) · [Evaluation and reliability](analysis/README.md)

